1
00:01:24,640 --> 00:01:25,520
Miss Tang, you...

2
00:01:25,520 --> 00:01:27,050
I'm going to find Yuwen Jia.

3
00:01:27,240 --> 00:01:28,400
Before I come back,

4
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:29,480
if he...

5
00:01:29,480 --> 00:01:30,440
Jingxuan.

6
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:39,080
If I don't come back safely,

7
00:01:40,759 --> 00:01:42,289
I'll leave him in your care.

8
00:01:43,840 --> 00:01:44,640
Miss Tang,

9
00:01:46,520 --> 00:01:47,979
you must come back safely.

10
00:01:56,479 --> 00:01:58,280
Jingxuan, wake up.

11
00:02:03,520 --> 00:02:05,200
If I'm not mistaken,

12
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:08,759
you've recovered all your memories, haven't you?

13
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:12,160
I haven't forgotten anything I should remember.

14
00:02:12,720 --> 00:02:14,580
Then there's nothing more to say.

15
00:02:15,480 --> 00:02:17,540
Yuwen Jingxuan without the Soul Jade

16
00:02:18,040 --> 00:02:19,560
is like a wild beast.

17
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:24,320
Even if you kill me,

18
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:27,440
how can he take on such a great responsibility?

19
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:47,280
Where is Miss Tang?

20
00:02:47,880 --> 00:02:50,040
She went to Lord Yu to get the Soul Jade back.

21
00:02:50,040 --> 00:02:51,040
It's useless.

22
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:54,200
From the moment I was born, that box

23
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:56,000
has recognized me as its master.

24
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:58,360
Yuwen Jia can only put the Soul Jade in,

25
00:02:58,400 --> 00:02:59,800
but he can't take it out.

26
00:02:59,840 --> 00:03:01,370
The same goes for Miss Tang.

27
00:03:03,480 --> 00:03:04,680
But I hope Miss Tang

28
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:07,320
can successfully snatch the box back this time.

29
00:03:07,320 --> 00:03:08,920
Once I take out the Soul Jade,

30
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:10,640
I will take the box back to Rouran.

31
00:03:10,640 --> 00:03:11,920
You are going back to Rouran?

32
00:03:11,920 --> 00:03:15,200
Why do you all ask the same question?

33
00:03:17,680 --> 00:03:18,520
Xiyao.

34
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:20,320
Are you still unwilling to give me a chance to make amends?

35
00:03:20,320 --> 00:03:21,180
You clearly...

36
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:23,880
I do like you very much.

37
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:27,520
But from the moment you sent me back,

38
00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:29,120
it became impossible for us.

39
00:04:00,160 --> 00:04:00,960
Miss Tang.

40
00:04:02,440 --> 00:04:03,320
What's wrong?

41
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:06,680
I'm fine, Princess Xiyao. Don't worry.

42
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:08,960
It's a pity that I failed the mission

43
00:04:09,080 --> 00:04:09,720
and didn't get it back.

44
00:04:09,720 --> 00:04:10,240
It's okay.

45
00:04:10,240 --> 00:04:11,600
I'll help you back to rest now.

46
00:04:11,600 --> 00:04:12,400
No need.

47
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:14,890
I'll go see Jingxuan first.

48
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:16,600
Miss Tang.

49
00:04:18,240 --> 00:04:21,279
If this is your fate with the Prince of Shuo,

50
00:04:21,440 --> 00:04:22,480
what will you do?

51
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:25,960
I only know that

52
00:04:26,280 --> 00:04:28,560
I must do my best in everything

53
00:04:28,880 --> 00:04:30,540
so as not to leave any regrets.

54
00:04:45,520 --> 00:04:46,960
Miss Tang, he doesn't recognize you now.

55
00:04:46,960 --> 00:04:48,090
You'd better not...

56
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:49,800
Jingxuan.

57
00:04:50,560 --> 00:04:52,280
Jingxuan.

58
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:56,920
Jingxuan, look at me.

59
00:04:57,840 --> 00:04:59,040
Look at me.

60
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:02,600
Jingxuan, I can't fight

61
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:03,530
Yuwen Jia alone.

62
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,440
You must wake up quickly

63
00:05:05,440 --> 00:05:07,080
so we can get the Soul Jade back together.

64
00:05:07,080 --> 00:05:08,200
Do you know?

65
00:05:21,520 --> 00:05:22,400
I know.

66
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:26,400
I know you can hear me.

67
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:30,330
I know you are still conscious.

68
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:49,440
When I asked you to take your medicine before,

69
00:05:49,440 --> 00:05:51,720
you secretly used it to water the flowers.

70
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:53,380
Now you've learned to behave.

71
00:05:59,080 --> 00:06:01,000
Why do you keep bringing up the past?

72
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:02,730
I haven't even scolded you yet.

73
00:06:03,080 --> 00:06:05,000
You went to find Yuwen Jia all by yourself

74
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,600
and got covered in injuries.

75
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:08,020
Does it still hurt now?

76
00:06:08,640 --> 00:06:10,040
You don't need to worry about me.

77
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:11,280
I'm fine.

78
00:06:12,440 --> 00:06:14,840
I couldn't get the Soul Jade back,

79
00:06:15,200 --> 00:06:16,160
but look,

80
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:18,360
Yuwen Jia couldn't do anything to me.

81
00:06:21,880 --> 00:06:24,920
As for you, you must be good

82
00:06:24,960 --> 00:06:26,290
and take your medicine.

83
00:06:27,400 --> 00:06:29,360
Let's get well

84
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:31,520
and try to get the Soul Jade back.

85
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:34,360
I promise you.

86
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:47,320
I think I'm going back to Prince Yu's Mansion.

87
00:06:48,280 --> 00:06:49,210
What did you say?

88
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:52,050
I'm going back to Prince Yu's Mansion.

89
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:54,680
If you return to Rouran, I won't stop you.

90
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:55,940
But as for Yuwen Jia...

91
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:58,680
I am Princess Yu.

92
00:07:01,200 --> 00:07:03,320
You want to pretend to reconcile with Yuwen Jia

93
00:07:03,320 --> 00:07:04,780
and then get that box back.

94
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:07,640
I know I'm in no position to advise you,

95
00:07:07,640 --> 00:07:09,000
but Yuwen Jia...

96
00:07:12,280 --> 00:07:13,080
Ah!

97
00:07:13,640 --> 00:07:15,600
Su Zhiye, put me down!

98
00:07:16,200 --> 00:07:17,520
Let me go!

99
00:07:18,080 --> 00:07:19,360
Put me down!

100
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:34,640
This scene really feels like a lifetime ago.

101
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:37,880
What can I do for you, Master Su?

102
00:07:37,960 --> 00:07:40,120
I would like to ask you for some medicine

103
00:07:40,120 --> 00:07:41,980
that can make someone fall asleep

104
00:07:42,200 --> 00:07:43,880
but is harmless to the body.

105
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:47,680
You want to use it on Princess Xiyao?

106
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:50,159
Yes.

107
00:07:52,440 --> 00:07:55,400
Master Su, you make perfect sense when advising others.

108
00:07:55,400 --> 00:07:58,040
Why is it different when it comes to yourself?

109
00:08:01,360 --> 00:08:02,560
Although I don't know

110
00:08:02,880 --> 00:08:05,740
how things will end between you and Princess Xiyao,

111
00:08:05,920 --> 00:08:07,320
I hope

112
00:08:07,320 --> 00:08:09,180
you can still respect her choice.

113
00:08:10,480 --> 00:08:11,280
Miss Tang.

114
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:12,520
Miss Tang.

115
00:08:12,840 --> 00:08:14,500
His Highness wants to see you.

116
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:18,560
Think about it carefully, sir.

117
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:43,880
What's wrong?

118
00:08:51,360 --> 00:08:53,490
An epidemic has broken out in Binzhou.

119
00:08:53,520 --> 00:08:55,720
Although the people I sent are capable,

120
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:59,400
they still lack someone who understands medicine

121
00:08:59,400 --> 00:09:01,240
to find out the source.

122
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:05,480
You want me to go there in person?

123
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:09,400
It would be best if you are willing to go.

124
00:09:10,960 --> 00:09:12,840
This epidemic came too suddenly.

125
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:14,760
I was caught off guard.

126
00:09:16,640 --> 00:09:18,170
If it weren't for my health,

127
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:20,250
I would really like to go in person.

128
00:09:22,520 --> 00:09:23,850
Then I will go tomorrow.

129
00:09:25,320 --> 00:09:27,180
Then I will arrange it for you now.

130
00:09:28,880 --> 00:09:29,680
What is it?

131
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:33,580
Just lamenting the hardships of the people.

132
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:34,760
Zhiluo.

133
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:36,920
What's wrong?

134
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:39,760
Nothing.

135
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:43,120
Stay safe.

136
00:09:44,680 --> 00:09:45,480
Zhiluo.

137
00:09:46,520 --> 00:09:49,050
I hope you can understand my good intentions.

138
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:06,120
Wait.

139
00:10:06,520 --> 00:10:09,640
Why haven't I heard about the epidemic in Binzhou?

140
00:10:10,760 --> 00:10:13,090
Stop! Turn back to the manor immediately.

141
00:10:38,280 --> 00:10:39,080
Don't come any closer.
